import VersoManual

open Verso.Genre Manual

#doc (Manual) "AQFT in brief" =>

%%%
tag := "aqft-in-brief"
%%%

This chapter is in preparation. It introduces algebraic quantum field theory to a reader who knows
quantum mechanics and special relativity: nets of local algebras on causal diamonds, the
Haag–Kastler axioms, states and the GNS construction, and what this project sharpens relative to the
1964 axioms. Lean appears from the next chapter on.
